data: {"id": "312aa302256f4efc-thinking-parallel_evidence-773", "run_id": "312aa302256f4efc", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已收到首轮可观测性 baseline 结果，现在执行 Kubernetes 侧的关键诊断（describe + events + topology）以定位 PendingUnschedulable 的直接原因。\n\n**首轮可观测性 baseline 事实摘要：**\n- **Metrics (Prometheus):** `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}` = 1，确认 Pod 仍在 Pending 状态；UID=`49f4b3a0-c450-44f9-8baf-ce88e4ed74c4`。无 running/failed/succeeded。\n- **Logging (Elasticsearch):** 空结果。Pending Pod 未启动，日志缺失是预期。\n- **Tracing (DeepFlow/Tempo):** 空结果，原因是 `pod_ip is empty` — Pending Pod 尚未分配 IP，无网络流数据，预期。\n\n**下一步：** 通过 describe、events 和 topology 获取调度失败的直接原因", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789112375802, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

